本当 の わたし らし さ を 取り戻 さ せ て
and let me take back

138
00:17:27,015 --> 00:17:28,875
that's so dope ! so cool !
that's so dope! so cool!

139
00:17:28,875 --> 00:17:31,535
you , too ! just kidding !
you, too! just kidding!

140
