マニュアル 通り なんて
Just following the manual?

146
00:17:44,415 --> 00:17:47,275
退屈 じゃ ない ？
Isn't that boring?

147
00:17:47,295 --> 00:17:49,295
あー しろ こー しろ とか
Ah, dressing like this or that...

148
00:17:49,295 --> 00:17:51,965
外野 は もう イヤイヤ な の
The outside world is already annoying.

149
00:17:51,965 --> 00:17:54,235
自分 こそ が 中心 だって
Believing that I myself am the center,

150
00:17:54,235 --> 00:17:56,585
信じる 人 の ところ で 世界 は 回る
the world revolves around the one you trust.

151
00:17:56,585 --> 00:17:59,085
真夜中 鏡 の 真前
Right in front of the mirror at midnight,

152
