156
00:18:08,065 --> 00:18:09,975
that's so dope ! so cool !
that's so dope! so cool!

157
00:18:09,975 --> 00:18:11,825
you , too ! just kidding !
you, too! just kidding!

158
00:18:11,825 --> 00:18:14,355
演じる の 嫌い じゃ ない
It's not that I hate acting,

159
00:18:14,355 --> 00:18:16,395
勿論 苦手 じゃ ない
of course, it's not that I'm bad at it either.

160
00:18:16,395 --> 00:18:18,395
欲しがり 過ぎない で よ もう
Don't be too greedy,

161
00:18:18,395 --> 00:18:20,905
自分自身 忘れ ちゃう でしょ
or you'll forget who you really are.

162
00:18:20,905 --> 00:18:22,825
nana na na na na na na
Na na na na na na na...

163
00:18:22,825 --> 00:18:24,925
nana na na na na na na
Na na na na na na na...

164
00:18:24,925 --> 00:18:27,015
意味 なんて ない 方 が 好き の lululu lulu
I like it better when it makes no sense.

165
00:18:27,015 --> 00:18:30,095
nana na na na na na na
Na na na na na na na...

166
00:18:30,095 --> 00:18:32,315
nana na na na na na na
Na na na na na na na...

167
00:18:32,315 --> 00:18:40,815
お隣 さん は 多分 「 良い 人 だ と 思う 」
The neighbor is probably "a nice person."

168
