When you want to wake your eyes up, or...

312
00:30:32,733 --> 00:30:33,433
飲みたいにゃんね。
Want to drink, nya?

313
00:30:33,433 --> 00:30:35,723
そらちゃん、違うときかニャ？
Sora-chan, is that a different time, nya?

314
00:30:35,723 --> 00:30:42,093
いや、でも、え、どうし、どうしてニャ？私だけが違うの？
No, but... wait, what? What's going on, nya?

315
00:30:42,643 --> 00:30:44,663
