Terrible! I thought for sure... but it's location-based, um...

347
00:33:18,923 --> 00:33:20,183
あ、なるほど、ここにタイアップが出ると、でもそれにしても私と違う。
Ah, I see! If it comes with a tie-up, but even so, mine is different.

348
00:33:20,403 --> 00:33:23,263
あ、でも、そんな気がしてたにゃ。
Well, even so, I had that feeling, nya.

349
00:33:23,263 --> 00:33:26,563
さっぱりしたいときにね、飲みたいにゃんね。
I wanted to drink when I wanted to feel refreshed, nya.

350
